  "id": "butternut-squash-ravioli",
  "name": "Butternut Squash Ravioli",
  "subtitle": "Tender pasta parcels with creamy squash filling and sage butter",
  "description": "Seasoned butternut squash, mascarpone, egg yolk, and Parmesan fill delicate wonton wrappers, served with garlic-sage butter.",
